      <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 16px;">Homecoming</div>
      <div style="font-size: 10px; padding-bottom: 20px;">107 Franklin St, Brooklyn, NY 11222</div>
      Located at the heart of Greenpoint, Homecoming is often the first stop of the day for morning coffee. 
      It's more than cold brew and oat milk though. Pick up a Record or Apartamento mag, grab a hand-thrown mug, or get the Homecoming specialty—flowers for a special someone. 
      There are a lot of great spots to grab coffee around us, but why not do it at the place surrounded by beautiful plants.   
    </div>
